Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.47,0:00:03.83,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Ugh, you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:03.83,0:00:05.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah. I think this is it, probably.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.99,0:00:07.87,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Oh well, figure it out once you get there!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:07.87,0:00:09.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on—
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.36,0:00:35.98,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,So how did it go?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.73,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,What was {\i1}that{\i0} world like?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:37.73,0:00:41.85,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,White-knuckle! If Asakaze hadn't been there, we'd be dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.85,0:00:43.62,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,It was no big deal.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.62,0:00:46.37,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,There you go again, acting cool.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.27,0:00:54.38,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Nagara found today's portal too.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.87,0:00:58.83,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah? That's incredible.\N That's his 13th one this week.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.83,0:01:00.01,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,All coincidences, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:00.31,0:01:02.88,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's right. Coincidences.\N It just sort of happens.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:05.69,0:01:07.93,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Coincidences, eh?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.47,0:01:11.44,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I put together this report on Nozomi's power.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.09,0:01:17.02,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I've had her observe the light that her\N Compass indicates for the past month,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:17.04,0:01:19.28,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,but I still haven't been able to figure out what it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:19.93,0:01:23.13,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,No matter how close we get,\N it always maintains the same distance,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.91,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and there's nothing we can do to affect it.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.31,0:01:30.66,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It appears to exist in a domain that cannot be observed by us.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:31.03,0:01:33.99,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,So how do we get to this place?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:33.99,0:01:37.29,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Yeah, that is the question.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.73,0:01:41.17,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Also, Nozomi is the only one who can see this light, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:41.53,0:01:44.11,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Does it even really exist to begin with?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.11,0:01:45.43,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:45.91,0:01:48.43,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely certain of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.89,0:01:52.68,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Yeah, but whether it's a way out is...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.67,0:01:55.02,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,It's starting to rain.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.77,0:02:00.41,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,There may be other powers that we don't know about yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.41,0:02:02.77,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Also, investigating the worlds inside the school,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.77,0:02:05.77,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,and perhaps what the light is,\N might reveal how we can get home.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.91,0:02:09.03,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe it will.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.51,0:02:13.17,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,But what {\i1}is{\i0} this world?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.17,0:02:16.67,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,And who exactly gave us these powers?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.13,0:02:26.18,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Yesterday, Murayama,\N who had been missing, was found in the jungle.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.73,0:02:28.75,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Albeit under somewhat unusual circumstances.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:29.33,0:02:30.56,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Here is a picture of him.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.27,0:02:32.19,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,Ew...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.55,Overlap,Classmates,0,0,0,,He's like a zombie.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.01,0:02:35.94,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Is there anyone here who might know
Dialogue: 99,0:02:36.25,0:02:39.47,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,if this is a result of another new rule in this world,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.47,0:02:42.15,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,or if this happened because of someone's power?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.85,0:02:44.95,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:45.35,0:02:47.16,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,This may be totally unrelated,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.16,0:02:50.58,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,but Inuyama also went missing about a week ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:50.85,0:02:53.91,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,A week ago? Why didn't you say anything until now?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.91,0:02:57.33,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Huh? I thought someone else would notice and say something.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.33,0:03:00.57,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Guess nobody was missing him.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.67,0:03:08.67,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,He may have gotten himself into trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.67,0:03:11.59,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,We also need to investigate this freezing phenomenon.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.10,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.10,0:03:17.73,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Unlike a certain someone,\Nwe don't have the time or any special powers.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.27,0:03:19.86,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.03,0:03:23.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.61,0:03:26.63,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,You don't have to work, and you've got the time, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.63,0:03:28.75,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Would it hurt to work with the others a little more—
Dialogue: 99,0:03:28.75,0:03:29.59,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Pass.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.97,0:03:33.12,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Well, shall we vote on it, then?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.62,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Nice and fair.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:36.57,0:03:37.85,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.85,0:03:39.25,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:39.25,0:03:41.63,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Oh. Then please do.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.53,0:03:47.63,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But it's too much for just one person, so can I ask for an assistant?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:48.65,0:03:51.14,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So, why me?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.51,0:03:53.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going to be much help with this.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.85,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Be quiet for a sec.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.33,0:04:03.63,Default,Mura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay, so I was thinking of streaming a new game today,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.39,Default,Mura,0,0,0,,{\i1}and so I've settled on this! Ta-da!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:05.39,0:04:06.97,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Is this guy for real?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:06.97,0:04:08.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.05,0:04:09.71,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,H-He's streaming a game.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:09.71,0:04:11.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Really? How?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:11.33,0:04:12.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Whatever, let's go find the other one.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.15,0:04:29.88,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Over there...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, are you Inuyama?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.35,0:04:35.67,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're Inuyama.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.33,0:04:39.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Just like Mura. Is he streaming a game?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.89,0:04:41.63,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.40,0:04:43.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Then what's he doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:45.53,0:04:46.63,Default,Inuyama,0,0,0,,{\i1}...two... {\alpha&HFF&}three... four...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.63,0:04:47.97,Default,Inuyama,0,0,0,,{\i1}...two... three... {\alpha&HFF&}four...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.97,0:04:48.55,Default,Inuyama,0,0,0,,{\i1}...two... three... four...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.71,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,H-He's working out.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.49,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I've got it—
Dialogue: 99,0:04:56.49,0:04:58.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,what these two frozen guys have in common.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:58.75,0:04:59.29,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.59,0:05:03.47,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,They're both guys that nobody notices whether they're there or not.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.47,0:05:06.17,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's why nobody raised a big fuss when they left.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.17,0:05:11.18,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But, there's not much we can do until we figure out what's causing the freezing in the first place.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.55,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Let's start with that.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,How do we do that?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.35,0:05:18.07,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Investigation lesson one: question involved parties.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.56,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, that, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:22.73,0:05:25.81,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Look, let me make one thing clear...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.13,0:05:29.05,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I'm the boss, and you're just my assistant,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:29.05,0:05:31.07,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,so keep quiet and do what I tell you to.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.07,0:05:32.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.07,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.45,0:05:35.71,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.08,0:05:42.58,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Okay, here you go. This one's yours.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:43.53,0:05:45.09,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Don't sweat it, it's my treat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.27,0:05:48.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You could give stuff to everyone else for free too, you know.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Why put them through the\N trouble of settling payments?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.97,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Because right here and now, this is reality.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:55.43,0:05:59.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Did rich people give you stuff for free back in the real world?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.01,0:06:00.47,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, I know, but still...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:00.47,0:06:02.45,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What, you got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.45,0:06:07.27,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,With the app, if you don't pay back every little bit that you owe,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:07.27,0:06:10.51,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,your stuff ends up burning to a crisp in that blue fire.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.51,0:06:13.67,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Which makes it so everyone has to work all day long.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.67,0:06:17.05,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Like I said, no different than how it was before, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:17.05,0:06:19.85,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's what happens when you laze about for so long.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:19.85,0:06:23.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,This is reality in a capitalist society. Get it?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.38,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Mura?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.91,0:06:30.25,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He seemed fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.72,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,There was no sign that anything was particularly off with him.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.43,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He's turned pitch-black and stopped moving, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.43,0:06:40.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,You don't think it's some weird disease, do you? Could it be contagious?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.73,0:06:42.13,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Yeah, dunno.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.13,0:06:43.98,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,No slacking off!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.47,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Oh, him?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.47,0:06:49.23,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard he used to stream games.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.23,0:06:52.11,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Apparently he didn't even have a single subscriber, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.11,0:06:53.86,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Does that have anything to do with this?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.99,0:06:58.37,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Inuyama? Inuyama, Inuyama...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:58.65,0:07:02.37,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,He {\i1}was{\i0} here until not too long ago.\N You don't know anything about him?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.37,0:07:04.33,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:04.33,0:07:06.87,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,He went drifting off, too. I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.69,0:07:09.63,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Got it. We're done here.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.63,0:07:10.88,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.17,0:07:14.88,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun together.\N I'd love to get to know you better.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:14.88,0:07:18.26,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Not me, but my power, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:30.67,0:07:34.03,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Mizuho,\N what are your cats doing here?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.57,0:07:35.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,They aren't mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.63,0:07:40.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,These are actually my grandma's cats.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.06,0:07:46.29,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But my grandma got dementia,\N and wound up in a home.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:46.29,0:07:49.29,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But nobody wanted to look after these guys,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.79,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,and I heard they were going to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.19,0:07:54.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,So I stuffed them in my bag and took them away.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.19,0:07:58.55,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Are you gonna tell the others?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.33,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, I won't. And even if I did...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.33,0:08:05.33,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Oh, and I could use my power before we went adrift.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:06.85,0:08:07.56,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.03,0:08:18.61,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,There's a good boy.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:19.23,0:08:20.61,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Wait, how'd that work?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.79,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I could only use it at school.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.37,0:08:29.12,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I'm sure there were others who had powers besides me, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.63,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,A strange power you can use while at school...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.19,0:08:50.64,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you. What's up?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.65,0:08:53.90,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Just a little curious.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:54.71,0:08:58.78,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Was this caused by this world's rules?\N Or maybe someone's power?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.03,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:01.53,0:09:04.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,We're trapped here,\N engulfed in flames, bound by a set of rules.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.89,0:09:07.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's how it's been ever since we went adrift.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.41,0:09:11.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It's almost as if someone's testing us, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.99,0:09:16.13,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,And who could that be? You don't think...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.47,0:09:18.27,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You knew, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.27,0:09:21.72,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,That the school would go adrift,\N and that we'd end up like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.91,0:09:24.97,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're going to go adrift.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.53,0:09:28.97,Default,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\i1}It will be into a world governed by the absurd.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.23,0:09:32.23,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah? Tell me all about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:32.61,0:09:36.23,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I did. There's a voice, you see, that tells me things.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.23,0:09:36.86,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:37.17,0:09:40.74,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,I was informed ahead of time.\N Sort of like what questions will be on the test.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.17,0:09:43.86,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Then the person behind that voice would have to be...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.61,0:09:47.12,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,Indeed, who could it be?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:53.13,0:09:56.00,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,It looks like we're not going to find anything without Nagara around.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:56.51,0:09:58.21,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I just happen to be on an unlucky streak.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:58.77,0:10:00.26,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I don't need him for this.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.81,0:10:02.88,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,You've been saying that for three days now.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.64,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, Tora, when did I order Ciao?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:08.53,0:10:11.39,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I asked you to bring me {\i1}canned{\i0} tuna, remember?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.19,0:10:18.40,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What's that attitude for?\N Fine, no dinner for you tonight.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Don't you growl at me.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.53,0:10:24.67,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around!\N Come on, this is no time for games, you know!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.67,0:10:26.31,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,There's been even more victims!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.91,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm working on it here.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.59,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Well then, what do you have to show for it?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.95,0:10:37.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,These are Mizuho's findings...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.59,0:10:42.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,All the victims are oddballs,\N and no one around them liked them.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.73,0:10:44.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This has led her to believe this has occurred
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.80,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,because they were excluded from their groups.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.21,0:10:48.80,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Somebody's probably picking on them.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.17,0:10:51.35,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,You mean it's someone's power?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Could it be anything else?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.81,0:10:55.44,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Then why don't we take a look at the power list?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.15,0:11:02.41,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,Hoshi asked us to survey everyone and put together a list of all our powers,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.41,0:11:04.49,Default,Cap,0,0,0,,just in case something happened.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.49,0:11:06.49,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,So, what do you want to know?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:06.99,0:11:10.91,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,We want to check if there are any powers having to do with this freezing.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:11.33,0:11:12.49,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll take this!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.81,0:11:20.87,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,There's a lot we're still not sure about,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:20.87,0:11:23.75,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,but we have a pretty good grasp of everyone's powers.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.27,0:11:30.13,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,It's gotta be said that there are some powers with surprising effects,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.13,0:11:32.01,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,and some that are surprisingly complex.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.01,0:11:34.57,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh, you're A-ranked?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.57,0:11:36.13,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What's your power?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:39.57,0:11:42.15,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,My finger turns into a light! Isn't that amazing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.03,0:11:46.15,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.51,0:11:48.53,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That gets an A rank?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.53,0:11:51.50,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Huh? It's awesome, right? It was in that movie!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.71,0:11:57.01,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hmm, there don't seem to be any powers that correlate with this.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.01,0:12:00.41,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,But I'm not even sure if we can trust this list.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.73,0:12:02.91,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Asakaze!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.91,0:12:03.92,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.35,0:12:08.17,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,I hear you haven't cracked this yet.\N And that Pony got angry at you.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.65,0:12:11.27,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's taking some time.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.71,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,In that case, it's all good if you don't join us again.{you don't have to go back there with us.}
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.71,0:12:15.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.83,0:12:17.93,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,We're doing fine without you there.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.39,0:12:23.69,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,And I just spoke to Nozomi,\N who said she was fine without you around.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.49,0:12:26.32,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.39,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Oh? You upset?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.39,0:12:32.87,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Well, if you really want, I could stick up for you,\N even though you slow me down—
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.87,0:12:34.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:34.93,0:12:36.95,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,That's a load off. Okay, that settles it.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.33,Default,Asakaze,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.33,0:12:42.43,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, it's perfectly fine.\N I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.43,0:12:43.29,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Thanks for—
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.29,0:12:46.03,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's so cool!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.37,0:13:01.83,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's Kaga, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.73,0:13:10.13,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that about earlier?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.13,0:13:12.81,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,What's he trying to talk you out of?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.39,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,None of your concern.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:14.39,0:13:16.99,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Watching you back there really pissed me off.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.99,0:13:20.95,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Thanks for what?\N You didn't mean a single thing you told him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.49,0:13:22.87,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's fine, really.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.87,0:13:23.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:24.09,0:13:27.21,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You actually think Asakaze is a scumbag, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:27.21,0:13:28.88,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You want to slug him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.55,0:13:30.88,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Buzz off, will you?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.39,0:13:33.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,It's fine. It's not like I—
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.89,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,So lame. You don't even have the guts to fight.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.57,0:13:39.59,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,There's no way I could beat him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.43,0:13:43.27,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter, does it?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.57,0:14:30.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.73,0:14:33.19,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,What are you doing in here?!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:33.19,0:14:36.95,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I-I'm Nagara, from Class 3. Do you have a moment?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.11,0:14:41.81,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Listen, everyone is worried and out looking for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.81,0:14:42.77,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.89,0:14:45.71,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, would you come back with us?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.21,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,I know that's not true.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.23,0:14:50.45,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,Nobody's worried about me.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:50.45,0:14:53.59,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,True enough. No one cared one bit.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:53.59,0:14:55.67,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,It's nice to be one of the gifted, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.59,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,It's so absurd, really—
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.59,0:14:59.60,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,always getting pushed around by them.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.85,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Kaga, how did you get here?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.27,0:15:06.13,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,I don't know. I just kept thinking that I'd had enough of this,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.13,0:15:08.19,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,and before I knew it, here I was.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.19,0:15:10.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Before you knew it, you were here?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.63,0:15:13.89,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,I'm sure God must have granted me my wish.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.55,0:15:15.24,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.51,0:15:17.24,Default,Mura,0,0,0,,H-How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:17.55,0:15:20.31,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Well, these blackout curtains are connected.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:20.31,0:15:22.74,Default,Kaga,0,0,0,,What do you mean? This isn't the only room?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.67,0:15:27.50,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Nobody's watching you, are they?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.88,0:15:31.35,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,You're just playing your game all alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:35.51,0:15:38.89,Default,Inuyama,0,0,0,,In here I can spend my time on whatever I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:39.91,0:15:43.26,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,In here, even idiots can get away from being made fun of.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.81,0:15:47.27,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I don't want to work.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:47.63,0:15:48.87,Default,Classmates,0,0,0,,I like it here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.63,0:16:00.91,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So the freeze really {\i1}is{\i0} some kind of rule in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.51,0:16:05.09,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Serves me right for being worried.\N These guys are just recluses.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.09,0:16:06.83,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Don't call them that.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:12.15,0:16:15.21,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,So do you think you can get the four of them out of there?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.21,0:16:18.89,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,And if you do, will their\N creepy figures go back to normal?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.89,0:16:21.68,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Probably. But they aren't going to come out on their own.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.68,0:16:25.18,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,So what do we do, then?\N Do you have any practical measures you can take?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.49,0:16:27.41,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.41,0:16:30.73,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,We could ask Asakaze to forcibly yank them out of there, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.03,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That would solve this.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.03,0:16:34.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,They said they don't want leave.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:34.73,0:16:36.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Okay, so we lure them out with money and stuff.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.75,0:16:37.94,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That won't help.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.87,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Here I was thinking you were good for something,\N but I guess I was wrong!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.87,0:16:43.55,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from? I'm just—
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.55,0:16:46.33,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,This is exactly why Nozomi is giving up on you!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:48.27,0:16:49.37,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.37,0:16:53.39,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,I don't know if she likes you or whatever,\N but she's been following you around like a puppy.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:53.39,0:16:54.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,It grosses me out just watching!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.46,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,She does not! There's no way!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.71,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,There, you see?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.71,0:17:00.47,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,If it doesn't bother me,\N then you should just leave it alone!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.47,0:17:03.75,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That's not gonna cut it! Not for you, and not for them!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.75,0:17:06.53,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,There are some things you can't know until you meet them head-on!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.27,0:17:10.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:10.79,0:17:11.97,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.73,0:17:16.13,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's why you said you'd conduct this investigation.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.13,0:17:18.11,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You wanted to see how powerless you are.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.11,0:17:19.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:19.47,0:17:21.83,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,You were a recluse yourself,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.83,0:17:25.99,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,so you lied about having powers\N before we came here to show off.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.61,0:17:29.57,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Just how messed up are you,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.57,0:17:31.25,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,to keep charging people for everything?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.65,0:17:38.88,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.31,0:17:53.52,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I hear the investigation isn't going so well.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:58.27,0:18:00.53,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Why the long face?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.89,0:18:08.03,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have come this far without you, Nagara.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:08.77,0:18:09.54,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.54,0:18:14.42,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Asakaze is nothing but talk.\N He can't find anything on his own.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.51,0:18:16.79,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.09,0:18:20.51,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,How are you doing? Close to solving your case?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.51,0:18:22.86,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,We found the people who've been frozen.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.86,0:18:26.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,But they all hate life here,\N and seem to just be hiding from it.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.53,0:18:28.85,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Where were they hiding?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:29.49,0:18:33.85,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,In a place with these blackout curtains hanging all around.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:36.29,0:18:38.73,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,They keep going on for as far as I could see.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:39.05,0:18:42.63,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Amongst it all, though,\N there are a number of gaps, kind of like pockets.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:42.63,0:18:44.24,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,That's where they are.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:44.24,0:18:48.99,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Oh, are you saying that you found a portal to another world that wasn't in the school?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.73,0:18:51.74,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.09,0:18:56.41,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Do you remember the world you found in the audiovisual lab?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:06.31,0:19:08.39,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Is this another portal?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.73,0:19:12.14,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,That bonehead!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.01,0:19:15.05,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Damn, does he piss me off.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:15.05,0:19:18.73,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Ah, this is so frustrating!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.95,0:19:26.11,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I went a bit too far as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:42.35,0:19:44.27,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Someone's raring to go.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.47,0:20:07.45,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,This is a phenomenon created by this world's workings.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.75,0:20:13.93,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Removing those who are excluded is one of its rules.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.21,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,They didn't become reclusive—
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.89,0:20:22.13,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,{\t(838,3215,\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&HFFF&\4a&HFFF&)}the truth is, they all...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.49,0:20:44.23,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,The depths of your heart...
Dialogue: 99,0:20:44.23,0:20:46.53,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,are always hard to dredge up.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.49,0:21:22.27,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,And with that, the case is closed.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:24.77,0:21:26.05,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.45,0:21:31.75,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,So, what I said earlier... I didn't really mean it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:31.75,0:21:32.40,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,I just got snarky—
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.40,0:21:33.91,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Neither of us did, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.99,0:21:37.16,Default,Mizuho,0,0,0,,Well, in any case...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.55,0:22:01.05,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,The portal disappeared, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:03.69,0:22:06.27,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,Looks like it disappeared over at the school, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.27,0:22:09.57,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,I guess it was {\i1}that{\i0} world that was causing the freezing.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:09.57,0:22:10.94,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.41,0:22:15.57,Default,Rajdhani,0,0,0,,But how did those two even find another portal out here?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.93,0:22:17.70,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,I had a thought about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:18.33,0:22:21.70,Default,Nagara,0,0,0,,Maybe Nagara does have a power...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.77,0:22:29.09,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,and maybe it's the power to leap into new worlds.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.03,0:22:34.67,Default,Nozomi,0,0,0,,And the portals are nothing more than the product of that.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.93,0:22:39.10,Default,Pony,0,0,0,,Huh, is this another power relic?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.79,0:22:59.69,Default,Hoshi,0,0,0,,A savior? Why, who could that be?
